<title>UK: Baltic Freight Index rose to 1,438.</title>
<headline>Baltic Freight Index rose to 1,438.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Baltic Freight Index for spot dry cargo shipping rates rose to 1,438 today from 1,430 on March 7, with the base being Jan 4 1985 equals 1,000. The BFI is based on the following sub-indices with rates in dollars per tonne.</p>
<p> Route Index     Rate   Prev Index  Rate</p>
<p>   1    1482    13.450	  1479    13.431</p>
<p>   1a   1444 10936.000	  1442 10925.000</p>
<p>   2    1740    24.857	  1730    24.719</p>
<p>   2a   1786 14643.000	  1770 14519.000</p>
